</div></section></div></div><!--close column table wrapper. Autoclose: 1 --><div class="flex_column av-m7xp1hyy-bf2515a2fb1f31afdaa0a97dbe5ee5b9 av_one_full avia-builder-el-15 el_after_av_one_fourth avia-builder-el-last first flex_column_div column-top-margin"><section class="av_textblock_section av-m7xovi1y-0a5f8181cdb02d144e1ab72784d43506" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock" itemprop="text"><p>You’ll benefit from our holistic approach to <a href="drug-addiction-rehabilitation.php">addiction</a>, which includes <a href="treatment-programs.php">medical treatments</a>, brain care, and comprehensive wellness programs designed to enhance your overall quality of life. At <a href="/">Casa Privee</a>, we proudly and uniquely stand at the forefront of medical advancement, combining cutting-edge treatments with a commitment to individualized patient care.</p>
</div></section></div>
</div></div></div><!-- close content main div --></div></div><div class="av-layout-grid-container av-aq84vq-33dd1bfc504d058d74a7790141dc19b2 entry-content-wrapper main_color av-flex-cells avia-builder-el-17 el_after_av_section el_before_av_section grid-row-not-first container_wrap fullsize" id="av-layout-grid-1">
<div class="flex_cell av-m7xp3ecq-9528ec8fefb544e8dae40699c2ee4122 av-gridrow-cell av_one_half no_margin avia-builder-el-18 el_before_av_cell_one_half avia-builder-el-first content-align-top"><div class="flex_cell_inner">
<div class="flex_column av-m7xp5ogz-cf5333b9a05ff2d0a30e4e797b39e39f av_one_full avia-builder-el-19 avia-builder-el-no-sibling mobile-text first flex_column_div"><div class="av-special-heading av-wakw6-849d30815059ca397fa5fd32b53bd9b9 av-special-heading-h2 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote avia-builder-el-20 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h2 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Preventive Medicine to Achieve and Maintain Wellness</h2><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m7xp4grx-dff4f2dcaa25adcc21021a4b77450d13" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>Are you ready to feel and look better? If yes, our commitment to preventive medicine will help you achieve and maintain complete wellness – it’s a better approach for your mind, body, and spirit.</p>
<p>Medicine, as practiced by most Western-trained doctors, is focused on treating disease. While it works for crisis situations, it falls short in helping you achieve and maintain a state of complete wellness. If you’re tired of seeing multiple specialists and receiving poorly coordinated care, let us show you a better way.</p>
<p><strong><em>We have a long-term commitment to individualized care for every patient or client.</em></strong></p>
<p>When you become a Casa Privee patient and achieve complete wellness, you’ll benefit in many ways from a proactive, holistic, personalized approach to improving your health care. We’re dedicated to helping you feel happy and fulfilled from the inside to the outside.</p>
</div></section></div></div></div><div class="flex_cell av-7n8iae-6b76e3e0dab1da2248486c6687d3f3b3 av-gridrow-cell av_one_half no_margin avia-builder-el-22 el_after_av_cell_one_half avia-builder-el-last content-align-top avia-full-stretch"><div class="flex_cell_inner">
<div class="hr av-m7xqwilv-f169428314cfc6548f86f91646910885 hr-invisible avia-builder-el-23 avia-builder-el-no-sibling"><span class="hr-inner"><span class="hr-inner-style"></span></span></div>
</div></div>
</div>
<div class="avia-section av-m7xp97gj-f1955b208e3a1ed24ee3e51f8c51e7e0 main_color avia-section-large avia-no-border-styling avia-builder-el-24 el_after_av_layout_row el_before_av_section avia-bg-style-scroll container_wrap fullsize" id="av_section_3"><div class="container av-section-cont-open"><div class="template-page content av-content-full alpha units"><div class="post-entry post-entry-type-page post-entry-1350"><div class="entry-content-wrapper clearfix">
<div class="flex_column av-5ge2na-1e188211e93e035d6a15c81fdec78342 av_one_full avia-builder-el-25 el_before_av_one_half avia-builder-el-first mobile-text first flex_column_div"><div class="av-special-heading av-3umeb1y-cf9c62e70527dc1ad5d94bd377528e97 av-special-heading-h3 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote avia-builder-el-26 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h3 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Our Philosophy</h3><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m7xp8rwo-19e6c48455cbae4493fe26e619ed3642" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>The Casa Privee Philosophy, established by our Founder and CEO, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bankole_Johnson" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Bankole A. Johnson, DSc, MD, MBChB, MPhil, DFAPA, FRCPsych, ABPM, ABSCP, ABDA, FACFEI</a>, is that achieving complete wellness for our patients and clients is essential to their happiness, wellness, and health, and will slow the effects of aging on the mind and body.</p>
</div></section>
<div class="hr av-12wrmk6-ae54f0503f4351ae4e921327d07187f1 hr-custom avia-builder-el-28 el_after_av_textblock avia-builder-el-last hr-center hr-icon-no"><span class="hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat"><span class="hr-inner-style"></span></span></div></div><div class="flex_column_table av-m7xpb3ka-ecd3b698a6e361ac0e79809c849a30d2 sc-av_one_half av-equal-height-column-flextable"><div class="flex_column av-m7xpb3ka-ecd3b698a6e361ac0e79809c849a30d2 av_one_half avia-builder-el-29 el_after_av_one_full el_before_av_one_half first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top column-top-margin"><div class="avia-image-container av-4vg9au-d098227fe404bcfeeb598feaa9f61917 av-styling- avia-align-center avia-builder-el-30 avia-builder-el-no-sibling" itemprop="image" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/ImageObject"><div class="avia-image-container-inner"><div class="avia-image-overlay-wrap"><img alt="Examples of Our Practice Areas and Services" class="wp-image-1381 avia-img-lazy-loading-not-1381 avia_image" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" height="450" itemprop="thumbnailUrl" sizes="(max-width: 576px) 100vw, 576px" src="../wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Examples-of-Our-Practice-Areas-and-Services.webp" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Examples-of-Our-Practice-Areas-and-Services.webp 576w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Examples-of-Our-Practice-Areas-and-Services-300x234.webp 300w" title="Patient and staff in our treatment room at Casa Privee in Miami Florida getting ready for a customized treatment program." width="576"/></div></div></div></div><div class="av-flex-placeholder"></div><div class="flex_column av-3u0is6-ea181aa0383dad61b8606ef656306a33 av_one_half avia-builder-el-31 el_after_av_one_half avia-builder-el-last mobile-text flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top column-top-margin"><div class="av-special-heading av-m7xpam2e-67a26fe7a6e4440e20d581627bd30586 av-special-heading-h4 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote avia-builder-el-32 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h4 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">It Begins with Knowing and Understanding You</h4><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m7xpauad-7c8389ffaba2961a8c30e5a46e9b3097" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>For you to achieve complete wellness, we must form a deep connection and understanding of you and your needs. Each of us is different, and our desires, goals, and dreams are personal and unique.</p>
<p><strong><em>Our exceptional health and addiction care providers understand that an intimate understanding brings a spiritual element to enter treatments as you progress through different milestones.</em></strong></p>
<p>You will instantly see how our approach differs vastly from the care you receive from a conventional medical practice. Our patient care is supported by a state-of-the-art, high-technology practice.</p>
</div></section></div></div><!--close column table wrapper. Autoclose: 1 -->
</div></div></div><!-- close content main div --></div></div><div class="avia-section av-11x4u06-2e71b405253a59e9984625737a0e3bef main_color avia-section-large avia-no-border-styling avia-builder-el-34 el_after_av_section el_before_av_section avia-bg-style-scroll container_wrap fullsize" id="av_section_4"><div class="container av-section-cont-open"><div class="template-page content av-content-full alpha units"><div class="post-entry post-entry-type-page post-entry-1350"><div class="entry-content-wrapper clearfix">
<div class="flex_column av-z4qpza-55892a416035275bbb5cd2a170448f0d av_one_half avia-builder-el-35 el_before_av_one_half avia-builder-el-first mobile-text first flex_column_div"><div class="av-special-heading av-xc5m9y-971af6de83d6ba89dc9165a57b0696d6 av-special-heading-h4 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote avia-builder-el-36 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h4 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Meet Dr. Bankole A. Johnson</h4><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-wlabqu-d95b37d734a970ed717cfd207db25b45" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p><a href="about-bankole-johnson.php">Dr. Bankole Johnson</a>, DSc, MD, MPhil, DFAPA, FRCPsych, ABSCP, ABPM, ABDA, FACFEI, is the Founder and CEO of <a href="/">Casa Privée</a>. He is an eminent pioneer in the fields of addiction and neuropsychiatry.</p>
<p>With a wealth of experience as a researcher, <a href="about-bankole-johnson.php">Dr. Johnson</a> has dedicated his career to understanding and treating <a href="drug-addiction-rehabilitation.php">addictions</a> and <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Psychopharmacology" rel="noopener" target="_blank">psychopharmacology</a>. He was the chairman of psychiatry at the University of Maryland, where he also led the brain sciences consortium in the neurosciences. He was also the former chairman of the department of psychiatry and neurobehavioral sciences at the University of Virginia. Furthermore, he has served as a professor of neurology, neuroscience, pharmacology, medicine, anatomy, and neurobehavioral sciences.</p>
<p>His credentials reflect immense expertise, experience, and a passion for advancing medical science. He has also made notable appearances, such as in the HBO Documentary “Addiction,” which received an Emmy Award from the Academy of Television Arts and Sciences, a further tribute to his status in the field.</p>
